note: turingosv4@61ec26c7 imported verbatim into runtime/ as squash single commit
(15,420 files, 1,187,661 lines). PINS anchor pinned 61ec26c7 — tree-identical to
re-verified 3bf6b2f3 (git diff empty), so the 2026-06-12 anchor re-verification
receipt (194 gates EXIT=0, workspace 2391/1, verify_trust_root ok) applies verbatim.
U2/U4 ruling per user authorization 2026-06-12: doc items, NOT blocking, land
post-import as follow-up doc atoms. No root Cargo workspace: nested workspaces
forbidden + daemon/target relocation would break build_app.sh (decision recorded
in import commit message).

POST-IMPORT RED ATTRIBUTION (full workspace run on THIS repo: 479 test binaries,
2843 passed / 3 failed initially → 1 amend-fix + 1 real-fix + 2 catalogued):

  RED 1 fc3_art_v2_constitution_boundaries_witness
    Cause: v4 constitution witness audits THIS repo's git history; the import
    commit touched runtime/constitution.md without a tracer anchor keyword.
    Fix: amend import commit message with Phase/directive/charter anchors
    (a3e50037). v4's constitutional guard fired correctly in its new home —
    treated as REAL, fixed, now green.

  RED 2 sanitized_runner::sandbox_cwd_is_explicit_workspace
    Cause: macOS /private/var vs /var symlink canonicalization — IDENTICAL to
    the catalogued baseline platform red (R1.9 §0.2). Disposition: catalogue in
    baseline_exceptions.list (A1_9_02, ratchet shrink-only).

  RED 3 constitution_true_suite_evidence_reconciliation::
        final_closure_source_tree_commits_must_exist_in_git_history
    Cause: evidence binds v4-history commit ff5d109e not reachable from HEAD —
    inherent consequence of user-ruled squash import_mode (history truncation).
    Disposition: catalogue in baseline_exceptions.list (A1_9_02, owned).

  RED 4 r_022_integration_orchestrator (9 shell tests)
    Cause: tests/integration/co1_13/_lib.sh derived PROJECT_ROOT via
    `git rev-parse --show-toplevel` — now resolves to host repo root, one level
    above v4 root. Fix (REAL, upstream-compatible): script-relative derivation
    (up 3 from _lib.sh). Rerun: ALL PASS. Class 1 test-scaffold fix per v4
    AGENTS.md §5; not a §6 restricted surface.

SHELL GATE FIXES (jurisdiction boundary, allowlist amended on card with paper trail):
  gate 5 market-claims + gate 10 dead-links now exclude runtime/ — verbatim-
  imported foreign legal domain; doc discipline owned by v4's own 194-gate suite.
  gate 10 had a FAIL-OPEN bug exposed by import: git C-quoted non-ASCII paths
  (§ in v4 directive filenames) crashed the python checker → empty output →
  silent PASS. Fixed: core.quotePath=false + splitlines + explicit
  GATE-SCRIPT-ERROR fail-closed on checker crash.

Baseline for A1_9_02 ratchet: exactly 2 catalogued reds (RED 2 platform,
RED 3 squash-history). Everything else green: 479 binaries, 0 unattributed fails.
